                        <span class="listing-2025-sidepanel-text--link">Guidance</span>
                        <img src="/-/media/HKEX_Common/Market/Listing-Revamp/Others/Listing-RHS-media/RedArrowOnTheRight.svg?mw=1000&amp;hash=DE877965F5BE46C7CCA1AEDCC46D7D48" alt="RedArrowOnTheRight">

